  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rQRLMll.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"1200\" height=\"200\"></span></h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#0f0\">&gt;概述</span></strong></span></h1>\n<div style=\"border:1px dashed #00ff00\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">探索一个全新的维度，灵感源自《黑客帝国》和计算机世界。与<span>漏洞、病毒和蠕虫</span>战斗，并制作各种机器。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">一些特性：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- 自动化炮塔和飞行器</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"> - 使用<span>SD卡</span>存储物品</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"> - 一台为你制作食物的机器，以及另一台<span>修复你的物品</span>的机器</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"> - Minecraft<span>暗网</span>，你可以在这里购买马鞍和附魔金苹果等稀有物品</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"> - 吸引附近生物的磁力方块</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"> - 比特币矿机<em>（非真实比特币）</em></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#0f0\">&gt;如何游玩？</span></strong></h1>\n<div style=\"border:1px #00ff00 dashed\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">使用字节和红色染料合成红色药丸，食用它，即可开始游戏！</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">所有合成配方均在JEI中说明。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">如果遇到任何问题，请<a href=\"https://github.com/BinaryQuantumSoul/BinaryMod/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\">在此处</span></a>报告。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#0f0\">&gt;兼容性</span></strong></h1>\n<div style=\"border:1px #00ff00 dashed\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">提供<span>英语</span>、<span>法语</span>和<span>世界语</span>版本。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">完全兼容<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\">Just Enough Items</span></a><span>和</span><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><a style=\"color:#0f0\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hwyla\" rel=\"nofollow\">HWYLA</a></span><span>。</span></span><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#0f0\">&gt;使用权限</span></strong></h1>\n<div style=\"border:1px #00ff00 dashed\">\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif\"><strong>免责声明</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>游戏内货币完全是虚构的，不应在任何情况下被视为真实货币。因此，所有游戏内的比特币均为无效。</strong></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif\"><strong>您可以</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif;font-size:14px\">- 在整合包中使用此模组</span><br><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif;font-size:14px\"> - 为此模组创建资源/数据包</span><br><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif;font-size:14px\"> - 制作展示或游戏玩法视频（如果加上此模组页面会更好）</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif\"><strong>您不可以</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif;font-size:14px\">- 向任何人收取此模组的费用</span></p>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
